From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 17:30:48 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 71/97] clk: samsung: exynos7570: add CMU_DISPAUD

Add the display and audio CMU, with the gates, dividers and user muxes the
DECON, the DSIM and the display SysMMU need, and the two CMU_MIF clocks
that feed it (the DISPAUD bus and the DECON video clock).

The vendor tables also describe an ECLK user mux at +0x218, but reading it
raises a synchronous external abort on this SoC, so it is left out and the
DECON runs from its video clock alone.

Signed-off-by: Hendra Manudinata <manoedinata@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 28dccb739c90f104dd1f0efd7c021716e9a3899f)
---
 .../clock/samsung,exynos7570-cmu.yaml         |  29 +++++
 drivers/clk/samsung/clk-exynos7570.c          | 103 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../clock/samsung,exynos7570-cmu.h            |  44 ++++++--
 3 files changed, 167 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

